{#-
  The ask for the blank fields' suggestions (suggestions/blanks.ts): the page as it stands, which
  is the long context, so it comes first; then every blank field, numbered; then the ask, last.
  Takes a SetupView (page) and the blanks (n, where, holds, length).
-#}
{% from "partials/setup.njk" import setup %}
{{ setup(page) }}

<blanks>
{% for blank in blanks %}
<blank n="{{ blank.n }}">
Where: {{ blank.where }}
What it holds: {{ blank.holds }}
Length: {{ blank.length }}
</blank>
{% endfor %}
</blanks>

Suggest what could go in each blank field above, so they fit the page and each other. Answer with a fill for each, in order.
